graph TB
    NASA[NASA POWER API] --> WF[WeatherFeeder]
    AV[Alpha Vantage API] --> MF[MarketFeeder]

    WF -->|publish| AMQ{{ActiveMQ Broker}}
    MF -->|publish| AMQ

    AMQ -->|subscribe durable| ESB[EventStoreBuilder]
    ESB --> ES[(File Event Store)]

    AMQ -->|subscribe durable| SPEED[BusinessUnit\nSpeed Layer]
    ES -->|read at startup| BATCH[BusinessUnit\nBatch Layer]

    BATCH --> BATCHDB[(businessunit_batch.db)]
    SPEED -->|incremental insert| BATCHDB

    BATCHDB --> SRV[BusinessUnit\nServing Layer]
    SRV -->|predict| ML[ml-api\nPython FastAPI]
    SRV --> SERVDB[(businessunit_serving.db)]

    SERVDB --> API[Javalin REST API]
    API --> FE[Web Dashboard]